: "CapuLegacyBannerArtNEW.png", "id": "1599338048480117", "uri": "https://scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499308046_1599338051813450_5563321178865833444_n.png?_nc_cat=103&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=KdLXYmq58n8Q7kNvwFzcozT&_nc_oc=AdrXZqNU7cRU8IG0bqlh7af_PZ7f6o0gx64MI1-B9Ri-aM8r4HqmzTgyJpeMejXSyds&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQRMsCbfCUB0MrMZLlZTHJcLn-50raR8rdQVi3_jRXzg9Q&oe=6B006C5A"}, "display_name": "CapuLegacy", "keywords": ["Monkey", "Apes", "Gorilla", "capu", "Horror"], "long_description": "**CapuLegacy** is a project maintained and created by Legacy Games, who now own Capuchin, which is aimed to bring back what people know as \"OG Capuchin\"! CapuLegacy is a *full remake* of Capuchin V1, made from the ground up without using any stolen content. You can run around as a monkey with your friends and explore multiple different areas, like Zero Gravity, Shop, Sandland, Snowland, Horror, and so much more! There's also several different gamemodes to play with your friends, and new ones being added. Sandbox is multiplayer chaos if you're into that, and horror modes galore for those looking for a scare. Our constant and consistently quality updates will never let the fun stop!\n\nThis is an image of the multiplayer 'Sandbox' gamemode, which you can play right now.\n{1417284817024853}", "short_description": "CapuLegacy\n\nReturning an old classic for the new generation, remade completely from the ground up."}]}, "developer_name": "LegacyGames LLC", "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://sites.google.com/view/capulegacy/privacy-policy", "developer_terms_of_service_url": "https://sites.google.com/view/capulegacy/terms-of-service", "publisher_name": "LegacyGames LLC", "support_website_url": "https://discord.gg/capuchin", "website_url": "https://sites.google.com/view/capulegacy", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_SOME", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "2743326035